  "type_rules":["Every authoritative mutation uses COMMAND_ENVELOPE_V1 and exact owner command input; Task lifecycle/outcome values are never accepted as client-owned Inventory facts and must be reread from LLD-05 when required.","No physical Spare Part Unit identity appears in an RMA response before RecordRmaInboundReceipt creates the actual received unit.","Spare Request requester is creation-time Contact authority and remains distinct from editable receiver/logistics context."],
